{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_012C8jLnKoY3w7vjife7R1JX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: design-prototype\n3\tdescription: Turn a brief-backed screen idea into a reviewed clickable design prototype within the project's current design stage.\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\tRead `design-process`, the current brief step, project settings/rules, copy and UI map. Verify the pinned manifest at session start. Before each write run `\"$FANNAN_RELEASE/tools/readonly-precheck.sh\" \"/workspace/design-output/<project>/\" \"<project>\"`; use the reviewed safe-write path. Stop if either check fails. Work only in the project's design tool or standalone mocks under `/workspace/design-output/<project>/`; never edit code in the repo. Ask Fadel before anything paid, every time. See [security and install](../../references/security-and-install.md).\n7\t\n8\t1. **Plan:** state the goal, screens, current step, evidence, checks and any cost; obtain the project's approver's yes for the plan and record the task. Under the existing authority record this role resolves to Fadel; a different or missing mapping blocks the gate.\n9\t2. **Shape:** map one click path and each section to a brief line. Use the writer's real copy before layout; show missing text as `[placeholder]` with owner.\n10\t3. **Explore:** make 3–5 named, private variants along a clear design dimension. The approver chooses one; only that variant proceeds.\n11\t4. **Implement:** use `design-canvas` and the configured tool; if it cannot prototype, produce a standalone HTML mock in the allowed output folder. Respect grayscale through Step 5, desktop first and every text length/language/direction requirement. The prototype is reference only.\n12\t5. **See:** capture rendered 1440px frames, interaction states and accessibility evidence. Do not crop longer copy. At the end of Step 4, before the existing Step 5 grayscale structure signoff, run `FANNAN_DEPS=... node \"$FANNAN_RELEASE/tools/pre-handoff-check.mjs\" <DESIGN.md> <page.html> <evidence-dir> <project> <handoff.json> --phase=wireframe` for the full desktop set; it informs that gate rather than creating a new one.\n13\t6. **Critic:** a separate read-only reviewer scores copy and design together using [critic rubric](../../references/critic-rubric.md) and real references. Fix and rescore at most three rounds. Stop if a round gains <1 total point. A cap or stalled score is never a soft pass; send the scores and open defects to the approver. Any P0/P1 blocks handoff.\n14\t7. **Harden:** before Step 9 run `FANNAN_DEPS=... node \"$FANNAN_RELEASE/tools/pre-handoff-check.mjs\" <DESIGN.md> <page.html> <evidence-dir> <project> <handoff.json> --phase=handoff`. Require PASS evidence and complete [handoff contract](../../references/handoff-contract.md). WCAG 2.2 AA is the minimum.\n15\t8. **Review/share:** collect versioned private link, screens/states, evidence, critic history and walkthrough; use `design-share`. No public sharing without Fadel's yes.\n16\t\n17\t## Gotchas\n18\t\n19\t- A plan approval, variant pick and final design approval are separate records. Do not infer one from another.\n20\t- Missing copy/facts, manual accessibility checks or open questions block Step 9 even if automated checks pass.\n21\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f80f814-38ed-4ed2-80fc-18e1bfbe6740","uuid":"ec94232e-e9ef-4390-ad4c-fdae5bdcb1bc","timestamp":"2026-10-18T03:26:00.847Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/panel-r14/fannan/release/skills/design-prototype/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: design-prototype\ndescription: Turn a brief-backed screen idea into a reviewed clickable design prototype within the project's current design stage.\n---\n\nRead `design-process`, the current brief step, project settings/rules, copy and UI map. Verify the pinned manifest at session start. Before each write run `\"$FANNAN_RELEASE/tools/readonly-precheck.sh\" \"/workspace/design-output/<project>/\" \"<project>\"`; use the reviewed safe-write path. Stop if either check fails. Work only in the project's design tool or standalone mocks under `/workspace/design-output/<project>/`; never edit code in the repo. Ask Fadel before anything paid, every time. See [security and install](../../references/security-and-install.md).\n\n1. **Plan:** state the goal, screens, current step, evidence, checks and any cost; obtain the project's approver's yes for the plan and record the task. Under the existing authority record this role resolves to Fadel; a different or missing mapping blocks the gate.\n2. **Shape:** map one click path and each section to a brief line. Use the writer's real copy before layout; show missing text as `[placeholder]` with owner.\n3. **Explore:** make 3–5 named, private variants along a clear design dimension. The approver chooses one; only that variant proceeds.\n4. **Implement:** use `design-canvas` and the configured tool; if it cannot prototype, produce a standalone HTML mock in the allowed output folder. Respect grayscale through Step 5, desktop first and every text length/language/direction requirement. The prototype is reference only.\n5. **See:** capture rendered 1440px frames, interaction states and accessibility evidence. Do not crop longer copy. At the end of Step 4, before the existing Step 5 grayscale structure signoff, run `FANNAN_DEPS=... node \"$FANNAN_RELEASE/tools/pre-handoff-check.mjs\" <DESIGN.md> <page.html> <evidence-dir> <project> <handoff.json> --phase=wireframe` for the full desktop set; it informs that gate rather than creating a new one.\n6. **Critic:** a separate read-only reviewer scores copy and design together using [critic rubric](../../references/critic-rubric.md) and real references. Fix and rescore at most three rounds. Stop if a round gains <1 total point. A cap or stalled score is never a soft pass; send the scores and open defects to the approver. Any P0/P1 blocks handoff.\n7. **Harden:** before Step 9 run `FANNAN_DEPS=... node \"$FANNAN_RELEASE/tools/pre-handoff-check.mjs\" <DESIGN.md> <page.html> <evidence-dir> <project> <handoff.json> --phase=handoff`. Require PASS evidence and complete [handoff contract](../../references/handoff-contract.md). WCAG 2.2 AA is the minimum.\n8. **Review/share:** collect versioned private link, screens/states, evidence, critic history and walkthrough; use `design-share`. No public sharing without Fadel's yes.\n\n## Gotchas\n\n- A plan approval, variant pick and final design approval are separate records. Do not infer one from another.\n- Missing copy/facts, manual accessibility checks or open questions block Step 9 even if automated checks pass.\n","numLines":21,"startLine":1,"totalLines":21}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_012C8jLnKoY3w7vjife7R1JX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
